@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### My projects (log in first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### Create a project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Shop A" }

### Get one project
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1

### Someone else's or a missing project (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/9999

### Not a number (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/abc

### Rename (admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Shop B" }

### Delete (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/1

### Gone (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1